{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めんどくさいところすきー\nしっかりしてるところすきー\nいつも頑張ってるれいか！\nありがとう！キャプテン！\nだいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん写っちゃった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう二期生と話しましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだちゃんとお話してないよー><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのへんの歴史が好きなの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこまで聞かれるととても\nマニアックな人と思われてしまう...\nどれがすきとかではなく\nストーリーになっているから\n全部楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところでまりっかさんて、\n拝見していて、自分の価値観を\nきっちり持っているから、外野の声に\n左右されない、という印象も\n受けるんですが、いかが？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです！\nでもこれが長所でもあり\n短所でもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、なんだかんだ\n影響されやすいし流されやすい\nとも言われるな！騙されやすいとか笑\nただ、自分の中でのこだわりは\n持ち続けたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事が辛くて辞めそうです...\n慰めて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私だったら例えばプリンシパル。\n辛いときもありました。\n逃げ出したくなることもありました。\nでも、私はみなさんの声援で\n逃げずにここまで来れたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私も応援してます。\n辛くても頑張ってください。\n自分で決めた道ならば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭に何をのっけたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メの撮影場所はまりかのお部屋？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の写真が好評で嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネックレスをぐるぐる巻きつけました。\n自分の部屋だよー雑貨だらけなの！\n........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなのブログ見た！\nやー嬉しい。\n素敵なコラージュありがとう。\n嬉し過ぎてコメントしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ前にね、\nブログ一から読んだとか聞いてて...\nなんだか照れちゃうわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段ツンツンしてるくせに\nもう、あの娘ったら//←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさんも\nマリカツするしか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/16/1112636/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日朝早くお仕事です。\nおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}